s://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/595","id":119249847,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDExOTI0OTg0Nw==","user":{"login":"cemkacmaz","id":4025150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjUxNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4025150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz","html_url":"https://github.com/cemkacmaz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-07-07T16:03:43Z","updated_at":"2015-07-07T16:03:43Z","body":"Hi, Andrew. Do you have any solutions about the latency of the video?\n\nIn devices with good connection the video opens up really quickly (below one second). But for devices with bad connection we have the problem that I mentioned at above.\n\nFor those devices that have low internet connection, we want to start the player a bit later (so that it loads some part of the video first, otherwise it either freezes too much or there are latency with the video). How can we change the start time of the video?\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/119249847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cemkacmaz","id":4025150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjUxNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4025150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz","html_url":"https://github.com/cemkacmaz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/119275926","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/595#issuecomment-119275926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/595","id":119275926,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDExOTI3NTkyNg==","user":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-07-07T17:27:44Z","updated_at":"2015-07-07T17:27:44Z","body":"The player should enter the ready state only when it has enough audio and video buffered to begin playback immediately.\n\nI tried playing back a sample MP4 video in the demo app over a slow internet connection, and saw the expected behavior: the state changed from preparing to buffering (showing the first frame of video) then ready. The audio and video streams started at the same time on the transition to ready, and were synchronized. Then the player rebuffered after a short time, due to the slow connection.\n\nDo you see video start late on all videos or only on certain streams? Can you reproduce the issue in the demo app? Thanks.\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/119275926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/120036211","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/595#issuecomment-120036211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/595","id":120036211,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDEyMDAzNjIxMQ==","user":{"login":"cemkacmaz","id":4025150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjUxNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4025150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz","html_url":"https://github.com/cemkacmaz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cemkacmaz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-07-09T15:33:28Z","updated_at":"2015-07-09T15:33:28Z","body":"Hi Andrew,\n\nWhen we use the streams in the demo app (like http://html5demos.com/assets/dizzy.mp4), it works fine video and audio synchronized. But when we try to play our streams (like http://dlfqdwwyrnn04.cloudfront.net/videos/odd20150709173759752774) the video always starts late. \n\nWhat could be the reason for this.\n\nAll of our videos are mp4 and codecs are AAC, H.264.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/120036211/reactions","total_c